WEBVTT

00:00:28.135 --> 00:00:30.611
I expected to solve
the world's problems --

00:00:30.635 --> 00:00:33.387
more specifically,
the world's water problems --

00:00:33.411 --> 00:00:35.118
with my technology.

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:37.458
I had a lot to learn.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.114
It was seductive,

00:00:40.138 --> 00:00:44.470
believing that our biggest
water quality problems persist

00:00:44.494 --> 00:00:46.947
because they're so hard to identify.

00:00:47.532 --> 00:00:49.199
And I presumed

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:54.303
that we just needed simpler, faster
and more affordable sensors.

00:00:55.071 --> 00:00:56.375
I was wrong.

